OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 83, guilty of murder after
OL,4,Astabbing nephew
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 83-year-old man, who stabbed his
OL,7,Fnephew 11 times and then started a fire
OL,8,Fto cover up the killing, has been found
OL,9,Fguilty of murder.
OL,11,FFirefighters found Andrew Avery, 65,
OL,12,Flying in a smoke-filled house in
OL,13,FGosport, Hampshire, in November 2024.
OL,15,FDefendant Alan Wotton, who was living
OL,16,Fin the property which Avery was trying
OL,17,Fto sell, believed his nephew was trying
OL,18,Fto defraud him, Portsmouth Crown Court
OL,19,Fwas told.
OL,21,FWotton is due to be sentenced on 22
OL,22,FOctober.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
